00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:15.099
- I'm from Santa Maria, California,

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:17.060
and I am Mexican and Irish.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.396
- I was born in Havana, Cuba.

00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:47.631
- Oh.

00:00:49.177 --> 00:00:49.842
- You're cheap.

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:50.940
Because you're cheap.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.584
- Not cheap.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.054
- She's looking in the
mirror, but she's like,

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:56.557
"(sighs) I'm getting old.

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:57.641
"My skin-- (sighs)"

00:00:57.641 --> 00:00:59.634
- She doesn't really talk
about herself a lot (laughs).

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:01.061
She talks about other people.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.272
She'll be like, "Remember Margarita?

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:05.691
"Margarita. You don't know Margarita?"

00:01:11.614 --> 00:01:12.657
(frustrated sounds)

00:01:12.657 --> 00:01:13.824
(laughter)

00:01:15.104 --> 00:01:16.243
- Ah, no?

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:20.080
- Sierra, you can talk to me.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.539
What are you doing?

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:21.915
Where are you?

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:22.616
- I can't talk.

00:01:22.616 --> 00:01:23.459
I'm busy.

00:01:23.459 --> 00:01:24.501
I'll call you later!

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:25.002
Click. (laughs)

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:26.420
- Don't tell me you're busy!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:26.879
(exasperated sigh)

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:27.716
- I call her again.

00:01:27.716 --> 00:01:29.298
(laughter)

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:32.134
- Did you see what Margarita put

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.553
on her Facebook yesterday as her status?

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:36.221
- Mom, who's Margarita?

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.556
- Margarita, Jenny!

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:39.933
Margarita, the girl who
went to your graduation,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:43.553
and she (high speed chipmunk voice)

00:01:43.553 --> 00:01:45.721
- Nope, I don't know who she is, Mom.

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:46.857
- What'd you eat?

00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:53.071
(laughs)

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.449
- One time is enough!

00:01:55.449 --> 00:01:57.107
(relaxed dance music)

00:01:58.911 --> 00:02:00.412
(laughs)

00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:01.205
- This is Sierra.

00:02:01.205 --> 00:02:02.206
- That's right. (laughs)

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:07.920
- Boom, boom, boom.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.087
That's how I dance.

00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:12.467
- She goes like this, and
like this, and all around.

00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:13.884
- I'm a hula dancer?

00:02:17.638 --> 00:02:19.390
- Oh, gang signs!

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.351
(laughter)

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.271
- All right, I'm gonna go now.

00:02:26.271 --> 00:02:27.314
- Okay.

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:28.141
- All right.

00:02:28.141 --> 00:02:28.982
- All right.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.566
- Love you.

00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:30.275
- Love you.

00:02:30.275 --> 00:02:31.434
- [Jenny] Bye.
- [Mercy] Bye.

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:32.486
- I love you, Mom!

00:02:32.486 --> 00:02:33.529
Bye!

00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:34.563
- I don't say it like that!

00:02:34.563 --> 00:02:35.280
- Yeah, you do.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.156
- No I don't!

00:02:48.128 --> 00:02:49.118
- That's true.

00:02:51.589 --> 00:02:53.173
- She's like the sister that I never had.

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.174
- She's like, yeah.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.427
- And my little daughter, and my first.

00:02:56.427 --> 00:02:58.720
- My grandmother is everything to me.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.056
She's my world.

00:03:00.056 --> 00:03:01.594
We have a really close relationship,

00:03:01.594 --> 00:03:04.977
but especially now that she
can email me and Facebook me.

00:03:04.977 --> 00:03:06.979
- She was really young when she had me.

00:03:06.979 --> 00:03:08.438
- I'm still young. (laughs)

00:03:08.731 --> 00:03:10.441
- She would be like,
um, "You're not allowed

00:03:10.441 --> 00:03:13.402
"to play with Barbies, but
your mom gets out at 5:00,

00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:15.320
"so put the Barbies away at 3:00."

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.029
But I would play with Barbies

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.675
and put makeup on her and do her hair.

00:03:19.992 --> 00:03:20.592
- Yeah.

00:03:20.952 --> 00:03:22.276
Ew, I'm crying!

00:03:22.276 --> 00:03:24.496
(upbeat music)

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:29.793
